        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Sagging Door Reinforcement Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nReinforcement hinge used on wide or heavy doors to prevent door sag and to repair sagging doors. Brass pivot bushing with a 3/4\" offset (pivot offset matches standard 4-1/2\" wide hinges).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso see: <a href=\"/pages/how-to-fix-sagging-doors-part-1-doors-with-metal-frames\"><b>How to fix a sagging door article</b></a> to view this item installed on a hollow metal door. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GLO-CP-RP_size.gif?v=1704354706\" width=\"600\" height=\"220\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Reinforcement Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Door Reinforcement Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Header Plate Width: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Header Plate Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Plate Width: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Plate Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.200\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pivot Offset: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Brass Pivot Bushing for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 8 each #14 x 1\" FHWS, 8 each 1/4-20 x 3/4\" FHMS and 2 each Sex Nuts</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Chrome</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware and installation template. For use with both wood and metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this Door Reinforcement Hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
